WEBVTT

00:02.170 --> 00:03.690
<b>We've arrived.</b>

00:04.030 --> 00:05.320
<b>Arrived?</b>

00:05.620 --> 00:07.880
<b>Huh? Isn't this just a field?</b>

00:07.880 --> 00:09.230
<b>It's the garden.</b>

00:09.230 --> 00:10.750
<b>The garden?!</b>

00:10.750 --> 00:14.340
<b>But it's as big as a sports field!</b>

00:17.140 --> 00:18.790
<b>Don't tell me...</b>

00:18.790 --> 00:21.550
<b>This beautiful castle...</b>

00:21.550 --> 00:23.300
<b>It's our villa.</b>

00:23.670 --> 00:25.480
<b>Lou Ertz Palace.</b>

00:25.480 --> 00:28.570
<b>What?!</b>

00:28.570 --> 00:31.570
<b>I wonder how many hundreds of times
bigger this is than my room...</b>

00:31.570 --> 00:32.780
<b>Don't think about it.</b>

00:32.780 --> 00:34.210
<b>Everyone!</b>

00:34.600 --> 00:37.200
<b>Thank you for your long journey coming here.</b>

00:38.310 --> 00:39.810
<b>Welcome...</b>

00:39.810 --> 00:41.550
<b>...to Lou Ertz Palace.</b>

00:43.560 --> 00:48.190
<b>Episode 5: Three Sisters' War (Alice Can't Hold Back)</b>

00:43.560 --> 00:45.350
<b>During the vacation,</b>

00:45.350 --> 00:48.190
<b>this mansion will be your home.</b>

00:48.190 --> 00:52.790
<b>Imperial soldiers, to think you'd
walk right into our trap...</b>

00:52.790 --> 00:54.580
<b>Prepare yourselves!</b>

00:54.580 --> 00:56.160
<b>This voice...!</b>

00:56.160 --> 00:57.250
<b>Lord Mask!</b>

00:57.690 --> 00:59.040
<b>An ambush?!</b>

01:00.570 --> 01:02.000
<b>There's no one here.</b>

01:02.450 --> 01:03.750
<b>Same here.</b>

01:04.440 --> 01:06.750
<b>That voice just now was
your voice, right, big sister?</b>

01:07.180 --> 01:11.620
<b>Was it too much of a shock for you,
Imperial soldiers?</b>

01:13.860 --> 01:16.610
<b>But it makes you curious, doesn't it?</b>

01:16.610 --> 01:18.640
<b>About what my Star Spirit is.</b>

01:18.980 --> 01:21.520
<b>Was that voice your Star Spirits Arts?</b>

01:21.800 --> 01:23.700
<b>It's called "Voice."</b>

01:23.700 --> 01:26.960
<b>It's nothing more than mimicry,
like a parrot imitating sounds.</b>

01:26.960 --> 01:31.360
<b>Among all those connected to the royal family,
it's probably the most useless Star Spirit.</b>

01:32.320 --> 01:35.780
<b>So please feel at ease.</b>

01:35.780 --> 01:40.710
<b>My Star Spirits Arts isn't even
capable of harming a baby.</b>

01:40.710 --> 01:42.210
<b>Are you self-deprecating yourself?</b>

01:42.580 --> 01:45.270
<b>That's not my intention at all.</b>

01:45.270 --> 01:50.330
<b>I think that I'm fortunate to have this
Star Spirit from the bottom of my heart.</b>

01:53.380 --> 01:55.620
<b>They are the servants of the Lou family.</b>

01:55.620 --> 02:00.250
<b>Yumirisha, Systea, Nami, Ashe, and Noel.</b>

02:00.700 --> 02:03.810
<b>Feel free to ask them
for anything you need.</b>

02:06.340 --> 02:11.320
<b>They are all Star Spirit users, but their
Star Spirits are not the offensive type.</b>

02:11.320 --> 02:13.690
<b>So that means they aren't
acting as guards too?</b>

02:13.690 --> 02:17.730
<b>Normally, it's impossible to serve
as both a servant and a guard.</b>

02:17.730 --> 02:20.080
<b>But Rin is a special case.</b>

02:20.520 --> 02:22.800
<b>Rin? Is she hiding somewhere?</b>

02:23.340 --> 02:25.900
<b>I mean, she must have tracked us this far.</b>

02:27.670 --> 02:28.650
<b>Don't tell me...</b>

02:29.060 --> 02:31.000
<b>Alice wouldn't have come here too, right?</b>

02:31.630 --> 02:33.810
<b>No, that's impossible...</b>

02:33.810 --> 02:35.180
<b>Dear esteemed guests,</b>

02:35.600 --> 02:37.720
<b>we have prepared your rooms.</b>

02:37.720 --> 02:39.080
<b>We will guide you there.</b>

02:39.080 --> 02:40.630
<b>But before that...</b>

02:40.630 --> 02:44.240
<b>We will have to collect your weapons,
communication devices, and the like.</b>

02:46.230 --> 02:49.900
<b>We want you to enjoy your
vacation without any worries.</b>

02:52.950 --> 02:55.590
<b>Even if you are soldiers
of the Empire we hate,</b>

02:55.590 --> 03:00.260
<b>by Lady Elletear's command,
we shall welcome you as guests for now.</b>

03:01.450 --> 03:05.930
<b>Ashe, these are the guests
I have personally invited.</b>

03:05.930 --> 03:07.150
<b>No rudeness allowed.</b>

03:07.150 --> 03:08.490
<b>Understood.</b>

03:08.490 --> 03:12.090
<b>Mixing muddy water into coffee
is absolutely out of the question.</b>

03:12.090 --> 03:14.630
<b>Aren't you just telling them
to do it indirectly?!</b>

03:14.630 --> 03:17.760
<b>If you're going to mix something,
at least add detergent.</b>

03:17.760 --> 03:19.930
<b>That's even worse!</b>

03:20.340 --> 03:22.410
<b>I can't let them know...</b>

03:23.070 --> 03:24.390
<b>...about my secret.</b>

03:27.800 --> 03:30.940
<b>There might be shards of glass
hidden in the pillow...</b>

03:31.530 --> 03:33.780
<b>It can't be helped
if I started doubting them.</b>

03:35.780 --> 03:38.070
<b>Are you fine, Iska?</b>

03:38.070 --> 03:39.330
<b>Sisbell.</b>

03:39.330 --> 03:41.270
<b>I came to check on things.</b>

03:42.860 --> 03:44.000
<b>What are you doing?</b>

03:44.370 --> 03:46.910
<b>It doesn't seem like it's in the bed.</b>

03:46.910 --> 03:48.050
<b>What?</b>

03:48.050 --> 03:49.380
<b>A bug.</b>

03:49.830 --> 03:53.630
<b>I never thought I'd hear
that word from your mouth.</b>

03:54.010 --> 03:57.470
<b>I, too, am on the side of caution.</b>

03:58.130 --> 03:59.930
<b>What's their purpose for eavesdropping?</b>

03:59.930 --> 04:00.970
<b>For example,</b>

04:01.290 --> 04:05.620
<b>they want to catch the moment when I leak
a secret of the Sovereignty to you.</b>

04:06.020 --> 04:09.680
<b>Isn't that something
Elletear's Star Spirit can't do?</b>

04:09.680 --> 04:12.150
<b>It's like the ability
of a recording device, right?</b>

04:12.150 --> 04:15.030
<b>It's not a recording device,
but mimicry.</b>

04:15.030 --> 04:18.270
<b>She can speak in the voice of anyone
she's heard in the past.</b>

04:18.610 --> 04:22.380
<b>Oh, so she can talk about things
that may or may not be true.</b>

04:22.380 --> 04:23.670
<b>Yes.</b>

04:23.670 --> 04:28.360
<b>Unlike my 'Illumination,'
it has no evidentiary value.</b>

04:28.360 --> 04:30.710
<b>Now, let's go, Iska!</b>

04:30.710 --> 04:32.580
<b>Let's find the bug...</b>

04:32.580 --> 04:35.090
<b>- and expose big sister Elletear's scheme!
- W-Wai...</b>

04:35.090 --> 04:35.900
<b>What?</b>

04:36.880 --> 04:38.090
<b>This way.</b>

04:39.950 --> 04:43.810
<b>It's easy to tell this is your room.</b>

04:43.810 --> 04:47.600
<b>It's a self-portrait I painted two years ago.</b>

04:47.600 --> 04:48.800
<b>For real?!</b>

04:48.800 --> 04:50.120
<b>About what?</b>

04:50.120 --> 04:52.560
<b>I thought it was done
by a professional painter.</b>

04:53.700 --> 04:56.440
<b>Now, let's go to big sister Elletear's room.</b>

04:57.290 --> 04:59.360
<b>Isn't this a photo...?</b>

04:59.360 --> 05:01.140
<b>What irony.</b>

05:01.140 --> 05:05.370
<b>Eloquence, education, grace,
and that unparalleled beauty...</b>

05:05.950 --> 05:07.720
<b>If she had a strong Star Spirit,</b>

05:07.720 --> 05:11.250
<b>there's no doubt she would
have been the next Queen.</b>

05:11.250 --> 05:15.210
<b>I thought all descendants
of the pioneer were powerful.</b>

05:15.210 --> 05:17.920
<b>Sister Elletear is the exception.</b>

05:17.920 --> 05:20.860
<b>But because of that,
she's incredibly devious...</b>

05:20.860 --> 05:23.780
<b>So I wonder what kind
of schemes she's weaving...</b>

05:25.530 --> 05:29.090
<b>It's locked.
It can't be helped.</b>

05:29.090 --> 05:31.850
<b>Then, let's check
big sister Alice's room last.</b>

05:31.850 --> 05:33.350
<b>Alice's room?!</b>

05:33.800 --> 05:36.100
<b>It is next to my room.</b>

05:36.100 --> 05:39.820
<b>There's a high possibility that someone
could be eavesdropping from next door.</b>

05:42.410 --> 05:43.730
<b>This is her room.</b>

05:44.770 --> 05:46.200
<b>Umm...</b>

05:46.780 --> 05:49.110
<b>This is big sister Alice's self-portrait.</b>

05:49.540 --> 05:52.090
<b>Did Alice always have three eyes?</b>

05:52.090 --> 05:56.530
<b>If I recall, she added one because
she didn't like the first one she drew.</b>

05:56.880 --> 05:58.790
<b>She has 10 arms, though.</b>

05:58.790 --> 06:00.220
<b>Those are her hair.</b>

06:00.220 --> 06:04.090
<b>Ah, I see.
This must be a surrealist technique.</b>

06:04.090 --> 06:06.300
<b>Not an imitation of Alice's
outward appearance,</b>

06:06.300 --> 06:09.060
<b>but a fusion of her inner
liberation and ideals...</b>

06:09.060 --> 06:12.290
<b>No, she's just simply bad at drawing.</b>

06:12.730 --> 06:15.980
<b>Um, you want me to go into Alice's room?</b>

06:15.980 --> 06:17.400
<b>Of course!</b>

06:17.400 --> 06:19.240
<b>We can't search the room if you don't go in.</b>

06:19.240 --> 06:20.360
<b>Sisbell!</b>

06:21.780 --> 06:26.160
<b>I'm not really used to going
into girls' rooms...</b>

06:27.790 --> 06:30.450
<b>But finding a bug here should be easy.</b>

06:34.080 --> 06:36.210
<b>Doesn't look like there's
anything unusual here.</b>

06:36.600 --> 06:38.810
<b>There's still one place we haven't checked.</b>

06:39.590 --> 06:41.130
<b>Her bedroom?!</b>

06:42.760 --> 06:45.180
<b>Wait, Sisbell...</b>

06:46.140 --> 06:48.390
<b>I don't think this is a good idea...</b>

06:48.390 --> 06:50.080
<b>It isn't here.</b>

06:50.080 --> 06:53.500
<b>But if it were me,
I'd definitely hide it in this room.</b>

06:53.500 --> 06:55.560
<b>That's it... No doubt about it!</b>

06:55.560 --> 06:57.770
<b>R-Really?</b>

06:57.770 --> 07:00.620
<b>My intuition tells me so.</b>

07:00.620 --> 07:03.440
<b>We're bound to find something amazing!</b>

07:05.320 --> 07:07.570
<b>T-This is...!</b>

07:07.570 --> 07:09.090
<b>What's wrong, Sisbell?!</b>

07:09.090 --> 07:10.940
<b>It seems I've opened...</b>

07:11.330 --> 07:14.260
<b>...the pandora box!</b>

07:14.260 --> 07:16.040
<b>Just what did you find there?!</b>

07:16.040 --> 07:17.880
<b>It's a great discovery!</b>

07:17.880 --> 07:22.450
<b>The fabric is so thin and delicate,
yet stretchy, and the texture is exquisite.</b>

07:22.450 --> 07:26.540
<b>I can't believe sister Alice was
hiding something this scandalous!</b>

07:26.540 --> 07:28.050
<b>Iska, what do you think?!</b>

07:28.320 --> 07:29.680
<b>Stare...</b>

07:29.680 --> 07:32.350
<b>What am I even imagining right now?!</b>

07:32.350 --> 07:35.880
<b>Is this what they call
a step toward adulthood?!</b>

07:35.880 --> 07:37.850
<b>Why are you showing it to me?!</b>

07:37.850 --> 07:39.770
<b>This is a crisis for the Lou family!</b>

07:39.770 --> 07:42.230
<b>What kind of crisis?!
What about the bug?!</b>

07:43.530 --> 07:44.570
<b>This...!</b>

07:45.310 --> 07:47.260
<b>I could understand about sister Elletear,</b>

07:47.260 --> 07:50.240
<b>but even sister Alice had
something this impressive...</b>

07:51.880 --> 07:54.040
<b>This has the smell of conspiracy!</b>

07:54.040 --> 07:55.370
<b>What kind of smell?!</b>

07:55.370 --> 07:57.320
<b>We're continuing the search!</b>

07:57.320 --> 08:00.250
<b>Iska, secure this for me!</b>

08:00.250 --> 08:03.270
<b>Wait, why are you handing it to me?!</b>

08:09.050 --> 08:11.360
<b>Focus, focus...</b>

08:11.360 --> 08:14.030
<b>No, wait, I shouldn't be focusing!</b>

08:14.030 --> 08:17.210
<b>I shouldn't be holding this...
I need to put this somewhere else...</b>

08:17.210 --> 08:18.640
<b>Can you give it to me?</b>

08:18.640 --> 08:20.270
<b>Sure! Here!</b>

08:20.270 --> 08:24.280
<b>Did my underwear feel
that good in your hand?</b>

08:24.280 --> 08:27.650
<b>No, that's not it!
The fabric is really delicate, so...</b>

08:27.650 --> 08:29.280
<b>I was trying not to squeeze it... Huh?!</b>

08:29.280 --> 08:30.780
<b>Alice?!</b>

08:30.780 --> 08:36.330
<b>What are you doing in my room?!</b>

08:36.330 --> 08:38.250
<b>B-Big sister?</b>

08:38.250 --> 08:41.170
<b>Sisbell!</b>

08:41.170 --> 08:43.840
<b>Noo!!!</b>

08:43.840 --> 08:48.170
<b>You didn't see anything here.
Got it?</b>

08:48.170 --> 08:49.800
<b>Yes!</b>

08:49.800 --> 08:50.940
<b>And you too, Iska!</b>

08:50.940 --> 08:51.510
<b>Y-Yes!</b>

08:51.510 --> 08:53.010
<b>You know what am I saying, right?!</b>

08:53.010 --> 08:54.830
<b>Y-Yes!</b>

08:56.770 --> 08:59.560
<b>Lady Sisbell! And Imperial Swordsman...</b>

08:59.560 --> 09:01.520
<b>Rin, you don't have to worry about it.</b>

09:01.520 --> 09:03.880
<b>Sisbell, we're going back to the castle.</b>

09:03.880 --> 09:05.650
<b>Mother is worried about you.</b>

09:06.610 --> 09:09.840
<b>Besides, you have important work to do.</b>

09:10.340 --> 09:13.180
<b>Oh, my, everyone's here.</b>

09:13.180 --> 09:15.450
<b>I'd like to join too.</b>

09:15.780 --> 09:18.450
<b>You too, big sister, please return
to the castle immediately.</b>

09:18.450 --> 09:20.160
<b>This is an order from the Queen.</b>

09:20.160 --> 09:22.050
<b>Come now, let's go.</b>

09:23.440 --> 09:24.710
<b>Sure.</b>

09:24.710 --> 09:27.350
<b>I see, so you won't go back.</b>

09:27.350 --> 09:29.180
<b>In that case, I should also...</b>

09:29.180 --> 09:29.880
<b>Huh?</b>

09:30.210 --> 09:32.970
<b>Sure. Let's go home, Alice.</b>

09:32.970 --> 09:34.910
<b>Huh? Excuse me?</b>

09:34.910 --> 09:36.430
<b>But...</b>

09:36.760 --> 09:38.320
<b>We'll go back tomorrow.</b>

09:38.320 --> 09:41.520
<b>The servants worked hard
preparing the beds, after all.</b>

09:42.080 --> 09:44.860
<b>Dinner will be ready soon.</b>

09:46.240 --> 09:48.280
<b>Alice, Sisbell,</b>

09:48.280 --> 09:51.650
<b>and the members of the Imperial Army,
please join us in the guest room.</b>

09:53.380 --> 09:56.750
<b>Oh, that's right,
I haven't introduced her yet.</b>

09:57.170 --> 09:59.620
<b>This is my younger sister, Aliceliese.</b>

09:59.880 --> 10:03.210
<b>N-Nice to meet you.
I'm Aliceliese, the second princess.</b>

10:05.420 --> 10:08.400
<b>Huh? I feel like I've seen her
somewhere before...</b>

10:08.880 --> 10:11.390
<b>Y-You're...! The Ice Cala—</b>

10:11.390 --> 10:12.800
<b>Please excuse us.</b>

10:12.800 --> 10:15.640
<b>- Have a good sleep.
- You must be tired, dear guest.</b>

10:15.640 --> 10:18.890
<b>Wasn't our boss about to say something?</b>

10:18.890 --> 10:22.270
<b>That's what it looked like to me too,
but I think it's probably fine...</b>

10:22.540 --> 10:24.320
<b>This is really exciting.</b>

10:24.320 --> 10:27.820
<b>A sleepover with the three
sisters under one roof...</b>

10:28.250 --> 10:29.650
<b>I'm so happy.</b>

10:29.650 --> 10:31.740
<b>Help me!</b>

10:32.540 --> 10:34.840
<b>First, be quiet and don't make a scene.</b>

10:34.840 --> 10:38.660
<b>If you agree to our demands,
we have no intention of harming you.</b>

10:38.660 --> 10:40.700
<b>D-Demands?</b>

10:41.070 --> 10:45.250
<b>You have to keep it a secret from your
subordinates that Lady Alice is a princess.</b>

10:45.910 --> 10:47.740
<b>You mean Jhin and Nene?</b>

10:47.740 --> 10:48.710
<b>Exactly.</b>

10:49.980 --> 10:53.250
<b>And you must not tell anyone
that I am the princess as well.</b>

10:54.050 --> 10:58.640
<b>Um... Do you mean you're a princess
of the Nebulis Sovereignty?</b>

10:58.640 --> 11:00.200
<b>You just realized it?</b>

11:00.200 --> 11:05.040
<b>I called the "Ice Calamity Witch" "sister,"
whom the Imperial Army fears,</b>

11:05.040 --> 11:06.930
<b>so it's only natural that I am a princess—</b>

11:06.930 --> 11:10.230
<b>Then that beautiful woman called
Elletear is a princess as well?</b>

11:10.230 --> 11:11.860
<b>What?!</b>

11:11.860 --> 11:13.970
<b>Took you long enough to realize!</b>

11:13.970 --> 11:15.030
<b>Good grief...</b>

11:17.820 --> 11:19.410
<b>I don't understand it...</b>

11:19.410 --> 11:25.250
<b>Why would big sister Elletear
let Sisbell stay at this villa?</b>

11:26.990 --> 11:28.630
<b>I'll stay too.</b>

11:28.980 --> 11:31.960
<b>Officially, my mission is to protect her,</b>

11:31.960 --> 11:33.670
<b>but there's another reason too.</b>

11:33.950 --> 11:37.220
<b>To keep an eye on us
Imperial Soldiers, right?</b>

11:37.560 --> 11:41.010
<b>Just so you know,
we're not planning to cause any trouble.</b>

11:41.010 --> 11:46.270
<b>Good. Because if you do cause any trouble
in this nation, I won't show any mercy.</b>

11:47.370 --> 11:49.840
<b>As a princess, I won't let it happen.</b>

11:51.260 --> 11:52.820
<b>So please promise me.</b>

11:53.430 --> 11:56.360
<b>That you will never cause
trouble in my nation,</b>

11:57.020 --> 11:58.830
<b>and don't run away from the estate.</b>

12:01.780 --> 12:03.240
<b>Lady Alice.</b>

12:03.580 --> 12:05.240
<b>What is it, Ashe?</b>

12:05.240 --> 12:07.620
<b>Is Mister Iska coming?</b>

12:08.160 --> 12:10.790
<b>Lady Elletear asked me to bring him.</b>

12:11.320 --> 12:14.040
<b>My sister did? Understood.</b>

12:14.510 --> 12:15.300
<b>Iska.</b>

12:16.510 --> 12:18.870
<b>Don't let your guard down around her.</b>

12:19.300 --> 12:20.300
<b>You're...</b>

12:20.660 --> 12:22.600
<b>...my rival, and mine alone.</b>

12:25.720 --> 12:27.330
<b>Please come in.</b>

12:27.330 --> 12:28.650
<b>This is Iska.</b>

12:28.650 --> 12:29.890
<b>Pardon the intrusion.</b>

12:30.270 --> 12:32.580
<b>Please, come in.</b>

12:35.800 --> 12:38.280
<b>Welcome, and thank you for coming.</b>

12:39.850 --> 12:44.000
<b>Oh my, pardon me.
I just got out of the bath.</b>

12:53.300 --> 12:56.460
<b>I'm looking for allies.</b>

12:56.830 --> 13:01.300
<b>In the Sovereignty, I have no subordinates
willing to fight for the same goal.</b>

13:01.870 --> 13:04.230
<b>That's why I invited you...</b>

13:04.610 --> 13:06.730
<b>...former Saint Disciple Iska.</b>

13:07.550 --> 13:08.560
<b>Me?</b>

13:08.880 --> 13:11.770
<b>Won't you become mine?</b>

13:12.610 --> 13:14.360
<b>I don't understand.</b>

13:14.360 --> 13:18.400
<b>If it's subordinates you want, the Sovereignty
must have plenty of qualified people.</b>

13:18.950 --> 13:21.490
<b>Because I want to destroy the Sovereignty.</b>

13:21.490 --> 13:22.070
<b>What?</b>

13:22.430 --> 13:26.810
<b>I want to shatter the current Sovereignty,
tear it down from its roots.</b>

13:27.630 --> 13:29.920
<b>Let's bring it down together, shall we?</b>

13:31.600 --> 13:36.080
<b>Why? What if this gets
into the Queen's ear?</b>

13:37.160 --> 13:38.550
<b>Just kidding.</b>

13:38.550 --> 13:39.400
<b>Huh?</b>

13:39.400 --> 13:44.780
<b>As the first princess, there's no way I'd
be plotting something so outrageous.</b>

13:45.160 --> 13:48.070
<b>The real reason I called you
was simple curiosity.</b>

13:48.070 --> 13:51.570
<b>I never imagined a Saint Disciple
would help a witch escape from prison.</b>

13:52.020 --> 13:53.900
<b>You even investigated that far...</b>

13:53.900 --> 13:58.250
<b>I heard there's an oddball
in the Imperial Army</b>

13:58.250 --> 14:00.950
<b>they call 'a battle-hardened maniac.'</b>

14:00.950 --> 14:06.030
<b>The lowest-ranked Saint Disciple who captured
a pureblood of the Sovereignty and then tried</b>

14:06.030 --> 14:07.950
<b>to force a peace negotiation.</b>

14:09.400 --> 14:13.600
<b>Very few people know
about my true goal...</b>

14:14.170 --> 14:17.370
<b>This princess... is she in contact
with someone inside the Empire?</b>

14:17.370 --> 14:18.950
<b>If so, who?</b>

14:20.700 --> 14:24.650
<b>It's 11 p.m.
Which means the castle's bedtime.</b>

14:25.240 --> 14:28.100
<b>So our conversation ends here?</b>

14:28.100 --> 14:30.470
<b>I appreciate how quick you are
to catch on.</b>

14:32.870 --> 14:34.500
<b>Come, this way.</b>

14:35.530 --> 14:37.060
<b>What do you mean by that?</b>

14:37.480 --> 14:40.530
<b>I don't have any bodyguards, you see.</b>

14:40.530 --> 14:43.280
<b>So nights can be unsettling for me.</b>

14:43.700 --> 14:44.780
<b>Huh...</b>

14:44.780 --> 14:48.720
<b>That's why I'd be so happy
if you could sleep beside me.</b>

14:48.720 --> 14:50.660
<b>What?! Absolutely not!</b>

14:50.660 --> 14:53.220
<b>I mean, I'm the Imperial Army!</b>

14:54.330 --> 14:59.090
<b>Seeing someone as strong
as a Saint Disciple so flustered...</b>

14:59.510 --> 15:03.260
<b>I must say,
I'm starting to quite enjoy this.</b>

15:03.260 --> 15:05.730
<b>Now, Iska...</b>

15:07.220 --> 15:09.010
<b>What are you doing to him?!</b>

15:09.290 --> 15:10.890
<b>Oh, Sisbell?</b>

15:10.890 --> 15:14.370
<b>You've really done it now,
big sister Elletear!</b>

15:14.370 --> 15:15.940
<b>What do you mean?</b>

15:15.940 --> 15:18.730
<b>How dare you lay a hand on my Iska!</b>

15:18.730 --> 15:20.650
<b>My Iska?!</b>

15:20.650 --> 15:23.940
<b>Iska is my invited guest at the moment.</b>

15:23.940 --> 15:26.450
<b>That means he's practically mine.</b>

15:26.450 --> 15:28.070
<b>Mine?!</b>

15:28.630 --> 15:31.010
<b>Iska is a bodyguard I hired.</b>

15:31.010 --> 15:33.850
<b>That means I have the right
to sleep beside him!</b>

15:33.850 --> 15:35.410
<b>No, you do not!</b>

15:36.130 --> 15:39.840
<b>Sisbell, the fact that
you're talking back to me...</b>

15:40.260 --> 15:44.460
<b>Perhaps it's my duty
to praise you for growing up.</b>

15:44.460 --> 15:46.830
<b>Stop right there!</b>

15:46.830 --> 15:49.720
<b>What are you doing, big sister, and Sisbell?!</b>

15:49.720 --> 15:51.510
<b>- Sleeping with Iska.
- Sleeping with Iska.</b>

15:51.840 --> 15:52.890
<b>Sleeping with Iska?</b>

15:52.890 --> 15:56.760
<b>W-W-What are you two even saying?!</b>

15:56.760 --> 15:58.600
<b>I won't give up my Iska!</b>

15:58.600 --> 16:03.530
<b>Oh my, Alice, wasn't this
your first time meeting him?</b>

16:03.530 --> 16:05.820
<b>Besides, he's an Imperial soldier.</b>

16:05.820 --> 16:08.190
<b>Precisely because he's an Imperial soldier!</b>

16:08.190 --> 16:09.350
<b>Sleeping with him...</b>

16:09.350 --> 16:12.390
<b>No, wait! I mean,
I should sleep next to him</b>

16:12.390 --> 16:14.120
<b>to keep an eye on him!</b>

16:14.120 --> 16:18.460
<b>Uh, I'd really prefer to just
sleep alone in my own room...</b>

16:18.460 --> 16:22.960
<b>My bed is big enough for all four of us,
so it should be fine.</b>

16:22.960 --> 16:24.540
<b>How about that?</b>

16:25.340 --> 16:27.170
<b>No objections from me.</b>

16:27.170 --> 16:29.180
<b>Hey, what about my opinion?!</b>

16:29.180 --> 16:31.510
<b>You three sisters, hold on a second!</b>

16:32.500 --> 16:34.720
<b>Let's draw lots to make this fair.</b>

16:34.720 --> 16:37.670
<b>Iska will be fixed to sleep
at the left edge of the bed.</b>

16:37.670 --> 16:39.650
<b>The rest of us will draw for position.</b>

16:40.240 --> 16:42.440
<b>I'll go first.</b>

16:42.880 --> 16:44.860
<b>I'm in the middle...</b>

16:44.860 --> 16:46.740
<b>I'm on the right.</b>

16:47.110 --> 16:50.380
<b>Y-Yes! That means I'm next to Iska!</b>

16:50.850 --> 16:52.450
<b>Big sister Alice?</b>

16:53.660 --> 16:57.220
<b>Sister Alice, switch your spot with me!</b>

16:57.220 --> 16:59.110
<b>No way! It's already decided!</b>

17:05.420 --> 17:07.740
<b>How can I sleep in this situation?</b>

17:07.740 --> 17:08.720
<b>Alice?</b>

17:08.720 --> 17:09.500
<b>Hush.</b>

17:12.300 --> 17:18.140
<b>Iska. Um... I have a position as a princess.</b>

17:18.140 --> 17:20.640
<b>So skin-to-skin contact
is absolutely forbidden.</b>

17:20.640 --> 17:23.900
<b>I'm not planning to do
anything weird either.</b>

17:23.900 --> 17:28.670
<b>Oh my, Iska, you're surprisingly soft~</b>

17:28.670 --> 17:31.170
<b>What are you doing, Iska?</b>

17:31.170 --> 17:34.370
<b>Suddenly hugging me like that...</b>

17:35.110 --> 17:36.350
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

17:36.350 --> 17:39.620
<b>I'm fine, but Alice...</b>

17:40.080 --> 17:41.920
<b>Could you move away a little?</b>

17:42.190 --> 17:46.450
<b>I would, but... Sisbell kicked me
from behind, so I can't go back.</b>

17:46.450 --> 17:48.630
<b>Just how bad is she at sleeping?!</b>

17:51.090 --> 17:54.550
<b>I can hear Alice's breathing so clearly...</b>

17:57.500 --> 17:58.970
<b>Where are you touching?!</b>

17:59.340 --> 18:04.060
<b>Amazing... Even though you look delicate,
you're actually pretty strong, huh...</b>

18:04.720 --> 18:08.190
<b>But you just said skin-to-skin
contact was forbidden.</b>

18:08.620 --> 18:11.010
<b>T-This is beyond my control!</b>

18:11.010 --> 18:14.200
<b>Besides, you're wearing clothes,
so it's not a problem.</b>

18:15.150 --> 18:16.740
<b>S-So...</b>

18:17.080 --> 18:20.830
<b>W-Would you like to touch me too?</b>

18:20.830 --> 18:21.800
<b>Excuse me?</b>

18:21.800 --> 18:24.420
<b>I mean, I'm already touching you,</b>

18:24.720 --> 18:27.880
<b>so if you don't touch me back,
that wouldn't be fair.</b>

18:27.880 --> 18:34.800
<b>Go on... If you want to touch me,
I'll endure it.</b>

18:34.800 --> 18:36.970
<b>You're making me sound
like some kind of pervert!</b>

18:37.450 --> 18:40.920
<b>I just want to have a fair fight with you.</b>

18:41.270 --> 18:42.720
<b>No matter the situation...</b>

18:52.890 --> 18:54.700
<b>Oh, but now that I think about it...</b>

18:54.700 --> 18:55.950
<b>What is it?</b>

18:56.360 --> 18:57.540
<b>You saw it, didn't you?</b>

18:57.540 --> 18:58.530
<b>Saw what?</b>

18:58.830 --> 19:02.040
<b>My underwear.
And you grabbed it tightly.</b>

19:02.040 --> 19:04.250
<b>That was a total accident!</b>

19:04.250 --> 19:06.270
<b>We're supposed to be equals, right?</b>

19:06.270 --> 19:10.590
<b>As rivals, I have the right
to see your underwear too!</b>

19:11.510 --> 19:13.470
<b>W-Wait, Alice! Hold on!</b>

19:13.470 --> 19:15.180
<b>Show it to me, Iska!</b>

19:15.180 --> 19:16.470
<b>Alice!</b>

19:16.470 --> 19:20.380
<b>Oh, come on, Rin!
Your lady's lost her mind!</b>

19:20.380 --> 19:22.310
<b>Do something!</b>

19:22.910 --> 19:25.560
<b>Lady Alice, did something good happen?</b>

19:25.560 --> 19:27.940
<b>Even your hair looks more luscious today.</b>

19:28.990 --> 19:31.860
<b>Sleeping together with my sisters
once in a while is not so bad.</b>

19:31.860 --> 19:34.360
<b>Nice shot!</b>

19:34.780 --> 19:36.700
<b>Alright...
Huh?</b>

19:37.120 --> 19:38.930
<b>That's unexpected.</b>

19:38.930 --> 19:41.550
<b>That Imperial Swordsman's
a total beginner at golf.</b>

19:41.550 --> 19:46.030
<b>Ugh, if I had been there,
I would've shown him how it's done!</b>

19:46.030 --> 19:48.000
<b>- I'll teach you.
- Ah, Sisbell?!</b>

19:48.000 --> 19:49.250
<b>- Oh, thank you.
- I'll talk with her later!</b>

19:49.610 --> 19:51.430
<b>Lady Alice, it's time.</b>

19:51.430 --> 19:52.420
<b>Time?</b>

19:52.690 --> 19:54.170
<b>Did you forget?</b>

19:54.170 --> 19:56.800
<b>Lady Elletear is returning to the castle.</b>

20:00.600 --> 20:01.930
<b>Sisbell.</b>

20:03.520 --> 20:07.770
<b>I came to say goodbye.
It's been a pleasure.</b>

20:07.770 --> 20:08.730
<b>Big sister?</b>

20:09.130 --> 20:12.640
<b>You hardly ever show yourself
in public, you know.</b>

20:12.640 --> 20:15.860
<b>Because you're always with your attendant.</b>

20:15.860 --> 20:17.490
<b>Oh, right...</b>

20:18.460 --> 20:22.990
<b>Shuvalts was kidnapped, wasn't he?
That must've been tough for you.</b>

20:23.760 --> 20:25.750
<b>Shuvalts was kidnapped...?</b>

20:25.750 --> 20:27.760
<b>How can you be so sure?!</b>

20:27.760 --> 20:30.640
<b>It could've been an accident
or a sudden illness,</b>

20:30.640 --> 20:33.960
<b>and I haven't even figured out
why he disappeared yet!</b>

20:34.240 --> 20:34.920
<b>That means...</b>

20:35.350 --> 20:37.880
<b>...the one who kidnapped Shuvalts...</b>

20:41.430 --> 20:45.020
<b>It was you...
The traitor to the Lou family,</b>

20:45.560 --> 20:47.560
<b>is you, big sister Elletear!</b>

20:47.560 --> 20:50.650
<b>Oh? What's wrong? You're shaking.</b>

20:50.650 --> 20:53.230
<b>The wind must've chilled you.</b>

20:53.230 --> 20:54.650
<b>Don't worry.</b>

20:54.650 --> 20:56.960
<b>If you stay quiet and still here,</b>

20:56.960 --> 20:58.820
<b>your attendant will come back eventually.</b>

21:04.500 --> 21:08.460
<b>Even a sun shining
in the night has its elegance.</b>

21:08.800 --> 21:12.000
<b>Now then, let's begin preparations.</b>

21:12.860 --> 21:16.960
<b>Elletear has just returned
to the castle right now.</b>

21:17.260 --> 21:19.970
<b>When that girl was born,</b>

21:19.970 --> 21:23.540
<b>I was sure a voice-mimicking spirit
wouldn't be enough to make her Queen.</b>

21:23.540 --> 21:26.880
<b>I was convinced
that the Zoa family had won...</b>

21:26.880 --> 21:29.810
<b>But we were outplayed, On.</b>

21:29.810 --> 21:31.830
<b>Indeed.</b>

21:31.830 --> 21:34.490
<b>The Hydra family blew up
the Queen's chamber,</b>

21:34.490 --> 21:38.070
<b>and Elletear used
that moment to mimic my voice.</b>

21:38.510 --> 21:40.820
<b>All to pin the blame on me.</b>

21:41.300 --> 21:45.150
<b>But what bothers me is
why someone as clever as her</b>

21:45.150 --> 21:47.950
<b>would resort to such a reckless move...</b>

21:47.950 --> 21:49.870
<b>You think there's more to it?</b>

21:49.870 --> 21:52.560
<b>She might be preparing for one final flourish.</b>

21:53.050 --> 21:55.060
<b>Which is why, Kissing...</b>

21:55.590 --> 21:59.520
<b>If something is going to happen,
it'll be within the next few days.</b>

22:00.660 --> 22:03.040
<b>No matter how you look at it, she's guilty.</b>

22:03.570 --> 22:07.890
<b>That sister of yours is the one
who kidnapped that old man Shuvalts.</b>

22:07.890 --> 22:10.230
<b>Jhin?! The way you said that...</b>

22:11.120 --> 22:15.490
<b>Why do you think she told her
that she was the one who did it?</b>

22:15.490 --> 22:17.550
<b>Most likely it's a warning.</b>

22:17.550 --> 22:20.360
<b>Basically, she's telling us
not to make any moves here.</b>

22:20.810 --> 22:23.660
<b>So, what now, young lady?</b>

22:23.660 --> 22:25.820
<b>You gonna give us
our weapons back?</b>

22:26.350 --> 22:28.320
<b>We'll return to the castle in eight days</b>

22:28.320 --> 22:32.330
<b>and expose the one who plotted
the Queen's assassination.</b>

22:32.330 --> 22:33.790
<b>You think you'll make it in time?</b>

22:34.200 --> 22:34.960
<b>Huh?</b>

22:34.960 --> 22:37.830
<b>There's a possibility something
outrageous could happen...</b>

22:37.830 --> 22:40.840
<b>...during the remaining
eight days you're here.</b>

22:41.510 --> 22:45.930
<b>You think big sister Elletear is planning
to make a move within that time?</b>

22:46.260 --> 22:47.900
<b>Exactly.</b>

22:47.900 --> 22:50.770
<b>So be ready to return
to the castle at any moment.</b>

22:51.210 --> 22:53.140
<b>Something's off.</b>

22:53.140 --> 22:56.620
<b>Iska and Sisbell didn't
come out of their room.</b>

22:57.110 --> 22:59.570
<b>Are they avoiding me?</b>

22:59.570 --> 23:03.280
<b>For an Imperial Swordsman,
that's actually the proper behavior.</b>

23:03.590 --> 23:06.200
<b>Was it ever since
big sister Elletear came back?</b>

23:06.590 --> 23:07.820
<b>Something's up here...</b>

23:08.210 --> 23:10.040
<b>As for Lady Elletear,</b>

23:10.040 --> 23:14.370
<b>it appears there will be a hearing
in the Queen's chamber tonight at eleven.</b>

23:15.730 --> 23:17.630
<b>It's about to begin soon.</b>

23:17.940 --> 23:22.380
<b>Elletear, have you ever
been afraid of the night?</b>

23:22.850 --> 23:24.080
<b>No.</b>

23:24.480 --> 23:26.970
<b>Do you feel that way, Mother?</b>

23:27.380 --> 23:29.530
<b>Lately, yes.</b>

23:29.530 --> 23:34.350
<b>At my age, I've started to find
the cold of night so unsettling.</b>

23:34.830 --> 23:38.100
<b>Please don't say such sad things.</b>

23:38.100 --> 23:41.780
<b>We still need you very much so.</b>

23:41.780 --> 23:44.980
<b>What saddens me isn't my aging.</b>

23:45.520 --> 23:49.190
<b>It's seeing my precious daughters
fighting and turning on each other.</b>

23:49.800 --> 23:51.950
<b>That is what makes me sad.</b>

23:52.260 --> 23:56.460
<b>Elletear, why did you
bring Sisbell to the villa?</b>

23:57.710 --> 24:00.070
<b>And the explosion in the Queen's chamber...</b>

24:00.530 --> 24:04.710
<b>You used your Star Spirit to frame
the Zoa family, didn't you?</b>

24:04.710 --> 24:06.930
<b>Please wait, Mother!</b>

24:07.200 --> 24:10.270
<b>I want to believe you're not the culprit.</b>

24:10.850 --> 24:12.010
<b>But...</b>

24:12.010 --> 24:13.670
<b>Mother...</b>

24:13.670 --> 24:17.440
<b>Please tell Sisbell she can
return to the castle now.</b>

24:19.520 --> 24:21.310
<b>Right on time.</b>

24:24.860 --> 24:27.570
<b>No... It can't be...!</b>
